/* getting-started orientation content */
const WHY_ENGAGE=[
 ["The barrier isn't attitude — it's the system","Most CALD audiences already pay, and most who don't, intend to. The gap is practical and psychological: an unfamiliar account-based system, no onboarding, and first notices that feel punitive. That makes it shiftable — if we help."],
 ["Trust runs through people, not institutions","CALD audiences build trust in unfamiliar systems through relationships, not letters from a company they don't know. A government-looking notice can read as a scam. The organisations communities already turn to are the credible channel."],
 ["It earns social licence, not just lower NAT","Reducing NAT among CALD audiences and earning the trust of the communities around the network are the same work. Done well, it strengthens Transurban's standing — done badly (transactional, enforcement-led), it erodes it."],
];
